msgid ""
"**A multi-dimensional spatial visualization engine** — a unified 2D / 2.5D / "
"3D rendering pipeline, built to \"see the essence of data.\""
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/index.md:5
msgid ""
"**Status: whitepaper v0.1.0 finalized + Phase 1 MVP complete + batch 4 "
"rendering hardening + batch 5 documentation rehoming (2026-09).** Full "
"positioning: [docs/whitepaper.md](docs/whitepaper.md)."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/index.md:7
msgid "What It Is"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/index.md:9
msgid ""
"An open-source, lightweight, embeddable spatial visualization **engine "
"kernel** (not a game engine):"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/index.md:11
msgid ""
"Unified multi-dimensional viewport: top-down map (2D), tilted view (2.5D), "
"immersive 3D free switching (currently a flat entity table; scene tree = "
"Alpha-tier candidate), with consistent interaction semantics for "
"layers/entities/annotations"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/index.md:12
msgid ""
"**Spatial data as first-class citizens**: GeoJSON, mainstream coordinate "
"projections (built in); tiled-vector MVT (directory/HTTP sources delivered); "
"raster tiles (PNG tiled basemap delivered); **tiled vectors and raster "
"basemaps stacked under one handle** delivered (each of the two mount orders "
"has its own live pixel gate, E817); WMS/WMTS serving (in progress, see "
"whitepaper §3.2 roadmap); glTF/point-cloud/BIM lightweight display; ODR/OSC "
"via official simulation plugins"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/index.md:13
msgid ""
"**Rust kernel + wgpu rendering**: memory safety, no GC; first-class Vulkan / "
"Metal / DX12 / WebGPU, with GL 3.3+ / GLES 3.0+ / WebGL2 fallback tier"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/index.md:14
msgid ""
"**SDK form factor**: embed into Qt / Flutter / C# (WPF/Unity) / Web via the "
"C API without hijacking the host main loop; startup size (native cdylib, "
"stripped) measured 7.25 MB ≤ 10 MB (evidence: "
"docs/reference/evidence/2026-09-24-native-size.md)"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/index.md:16
msgid "Architecture (One Sentence)"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/index.md:18
msgid ""
"`visiaengine-core` (data model / spatial index / coordinate systems / scene "
"graph) → `visiaengine-render` (rendering abstraction traits) → "
"`visiaengine-render-wgpu` (default backend: a from-scratch pipeline on wgpu, "
"settled by D4; backend abstraction kept pluggable). Hosts depend only on the "
"C API; backend choice never breaks the compatibility promise."
msgstr ""

