msgid "Development Status"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/index.md:38
msgid ""
"**Phase 1 status (numbers as reported by the gates)**: **11 crates** (10 in "
"`crates/` (incl. ffi) + wasm; workspace has 12 packages incl. the examples "
"shell package), **199** SDD behavioral contract clauses all green "
"(`scripts/spec-trace.sh` bidirectional tracing; `gate-docs` locks these "
"numbers to live reports). Rendering pipeline: "
"glTF/GeoJSON/point-cloud(PLY)/tiled-vector (MVT directory/HTTP source "
"mounting + viewport scheduling + pump loading) + material textures (GGX PBR, "
"WGPU-35/REND-45) + GPU instancing (100k building blocks in one draw) + "
"screen-space line width / true-round dot expansion slice + translucent "
"two-pass painter's ordering + directional-light PCSS soft shadows + "
"point-cloud EDL rim (`` `--edl` ``, WGPU-33) + postprocessing framework "
"(bloom/outline/tonemap/SSAO/depth-haze, WGPU-34/36/38, REND-43/44) + HDRI "
"loading (.hdr RGBE, IO-17) + SH-9 environment lighting (demo grade, "
"WGPU-39/CAPI-41) + text annotation (incl. CJK subset fonts) + profile "
"clipping + main/aux dual-projection minimap / click navigation + continuous "
"2D↔3D projection morph + picking (incl. point cloud REND-38 + line-feature "
"screen space REND-46) / parametric-curve tube/ribbon (REND-47) / measurement "
"loop + D7 far-coordinate rebase (pixel-verified). Offscreen golden: no SKIP "
"on real hardware; **ctest unified example registry (44 entries, incl. the "
"SDL3 window family xvfb substate) + three gates (abi/trace/docs) + "
"cmake-smoke four states (incl. installed tree) + pack-check installed-tree "
"hygiene + bench artifact chain** as machine gates; the tutorial E-number "
"system lives in [docs/tutorials.md](docs/tutorials.md) (filename = header "
"comment = index, single source).  Web example wall (43 entries — 6 live "
"in-browser on WebGPU, the rest detail cards; thumbnails stay self-rendered "
"via save_frame): the `visiaengine-wasm-serve` button assembles + serves → "
"`http://localhost:8017`. A self-signed TLS sibling (`pixi run serve-https`, "
"certs via `serve-https-gen`) serves `https://<LAN-IP>:8443` — https counts "
"as a secure context even when the cert is untrusted (measured on chrome "
"131), so remote WebGPU works without tunnels. **Host embedding**: C ABI 49 "
"entry points (+5 scene-tree ports + HTTP/raster tile sources + 3 property "
"hot-update ports + .hdr environment + rigid-body node transforms) (event "
"push / point cloud / profile / font annotation / flight / minimap "
"navigation, mirrored three ways in wasm·hpp·header) (human-reviewed "
"handwritten header + C demo fleet actually run) + Web surface "
"(visiaengine-wasm dual mirror, runnable demo page) — proven on a Qt host ✅ "
"(header-only widget + real-window smoke, three states); **install tree "
"delivered** (`cmake --install` produces 9 items: library + three headers + "
"licenses + `find_package(visiaengine)` how-to page + pkg-config receipt; "
"out-of-tree consumers compiled and run in both C/C++ forms, re-prefix "
"rebuild passes, the library ships its own SONAME so `NEEDED` records the "
"bare name); npm/pip packaging deferred to Alpha."
msgstr ""

