#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:6
msgid "Design invariants (outrank every diagram)"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:8
msgid ""
"**`visiaengine-core` never depends on `visiaengine-render`**: the data model "
"runs headless (headless image output/tests/Studio share one source)."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:9
msgid ""
"**The C ABI is the only stable boundary**: wgpu/bevy-grade types stop at "
"`visiaengine-render-wgpu` and never leak beyond the trait (this was the "
"primary reason D4 vetoed Bevy)."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:10
msgid ""
"**One semantic source; backends only add, never fork** (Unity's "
"three-mutually-exclusive-pipelines tuition): no backend may introduce new "
"scene/material semantics."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:11
msgid ""
"**The main loop belongs to the host**: the engine is only pumped, never "
"builds its own event loop (the rerun spawn/connect model is the reference, "
"the Flutter embedder is the ABI-discipline template)."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:12
msgid ""
"**Compatibility = tier parameterization, not compile-time forking**: "
"capabilities queried at runtime (§ figure ⑥) — capability_query: drawn as "
"design goal, not yet implemented (Alpha tier)."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:13
msgid ""
"**Copyleft dependencies (PROJ/GEOS/OSG family/LGPL pieces) are always "
"feature-gated into the extension layer**, zero contamination in the core "
"package's static link."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:15
msgid "① Full panoramic layering"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:17
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TB\n"
"    host[\"Host app layer<br/>Qt/C++ · C# (WPF/Unity) · Flutter · Web\"]\n"
"    abi{{\"C ABI — the only stable boundary, versioned handshake\"}}\n"
"    bind[\"Binding-gen layer<br/>visiaengine-ffi headers → bindgen / "
"csbindgen / pub\"]\n"
"    core[\"Engine core (pure Rust)<br/>visiaengine-core: scene graph, "
"coordinates<br/>visiaengine-geo: MVT, projection, style expressions\"]\n"
"    abstract[\"Render abstraction<br/>visiaengine-render: Trait + render "
"commands (IR), no GPU types\"]\n"
"    backend[\"Backend<br/>visiaengine-render-wgpu (default, in-house "
"pipeline, D4)\"]\n"
"    platform[\"Platform<br/>T1: Vulkan · Metal · DX12 · WebGPU<br/>T2: "
"GL3.3+ / GLES3.0 (±ANGLE)\"]\n"
"    host --> abi --> bind --> core --> abstract --> backend --> platform\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:29
msgid "② Crate dependency directions"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:31
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart TB\n"
"    ffi[\"visiaengine-ffi<br/>cdylib / staticlib + hand-written, "
"human-reviewed header (49 entries)<br/>gate-abi nm symbol count + gate-docs "
"signature-name-set double lock\"]\n"
"    core[\"visiaengine-core<br/>no wgpu dependency\"]\n"
"    geo[\"visiaengine-geo<br/>tiles · coords · LOD scheduling · style "
"expressions\"]\n"
"    io[\"visiaengine-io-*<br/>gltf · geojson · mvt · hdr · points · text\"]\n"
"    render[\"visiaengine-render (pure IR / Trait)\"]\n"
"    wgpu[\"visiaengine-render-wgpu<br/>wgpu · lyon · cosmic-text · rstar\"]\n"
"    ext[\"extension tier, zero core dependency<br/>3dtiles · odr (Beta) · "
"ifc (Beta+)\"]\n"
"    ffi --> core\n"
"    ffi --> geo\n"
"    ffi --> io\n"
"    core --> render\n"
"    geo --> render\n"
"    io --> render\n"
"    render --> wgpu\n"
"    ext -.-> render\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:49
msgid ""
"Iron rule: dependency arrows point down only; the independence of "
"`visiaengine-geo` — which now owns the style layer "
"(`crates/visiaengine-geo/src/style.rs`) — is the Open Core plugin boundary "
"coded into structure. Splitting style back out into its own crate remains an "
"option, not a current fact."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:51
msgid "③ One frame's data flow"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:53
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    ev[\"host events\"] --> pump[\"input pump\"] --> cam[\"interaction / "
"camera state<br/>(main world)\"]\n"
"    cam --> cull[\"1 CULL<br/>R-tree/quadtree + SSE picks LOD\"]\n"
"    cull --> stream[\"2 STREAM<br/>demand − cache → merge → throttle\"]\n"
"    stream --> io[\"background-thread IO\"]\n"
"    cull --> prep[\"3 PREPARE<br/>dirty flags → render-entry "
"extraction<br/>(viewport snapshot)\"]\n"
"    prep --> build[\"4 BUILD<br/>frame-graph recording (thin in-house "
"layer)<br/>shadow (PCSS 4f) → tile-2D → 3D → text\"]\n"
"    build --> enc[\"5 ENCODE<br/>→ wgpu command buffer\"]\n"
"    enc --> present[\"6 SUBMIT / PRESENT<br/>(non-blocking poll "
"semantics)\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:64
msgid ""
"**Scene storage settled (converged on this round's Unity-DOTS/UE6 "
"evidence)**: start with slab-handle indexing + dirty flags, **no ECS**; "
"should future performance evidence overturn this, the swap is confined "
"inside `visiaengine-core` and does not break the C ABI."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:65
msgid ""
"**Render-entry IR annotated cluster-ready** (the UE Nanite lesson): the data "
"structures reserve the meshlet/indirect-draw extension slots — unimplemented "
"in MVP, never sealed off."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:67
msgid "④ 2D/2.5D/3D unification and coordinate precision"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:69
msgid ""
"The projection is one continuous parameter, not three renderers: `P = "
"mix(ortho, perspective, t), t ∈ [0, 1]` — what is interpolated are the "
"frustum parameters; one single camera model."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:72
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    ortho[\"t = 0<br/>orthographic / bird's-eye (map)\"] --> oblique[\"t = "
"0.5<br/>oblique (2.5D)\"] --> persp[\"t = 1<br/>perspective (3D)\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:77
msgid "Coordinate precision:"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:79
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    world[\"world f64<br/>(ECEF / projection domain)\"] -->|RTC tiling| "
"chunk[\"render chunk local f32\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:83
msgid ""
"**Ruled (D7, 2026-09-03)**: three layers combined — core f64 global / vertex "
"f32 local (model·tile-level origin) / draw uniform f64 `origin−eye`→f32 "
"(viewer-origin, per frame). Evidence chain "
"`reference/evidence/2026-09-03-rtc-hierarchy.md`; implementation = the "
"GeoJSON slice, glTF's current path stays compatible."
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:85
msgid "⑤ Host embedding model"
msgstr ""

#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/architecture.md:87
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"    win[\"host native window handle\"] -->|raw-window-handle| surface[\"wgpu "
"surface\"]\n"
"    off[\"visia offscreen render\"] --> cb[\"texture callback\"] --> "
"comp[\"host composites\"]\n"
"    subgraph pathA[\"Path A — own surface\"]\n"
"        win\n"
"        surface\n"
"    end\n"
"    subgraph pathB[\"Path B — texture interop (Qt/Unity first)\"]\n"
"        off\n"
"        cb\n"
"        comp\n"
"    end\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

