#: /home/ubuntu/Documents/VisiaEngine/build/i18n-src/docs/tutorials.md:6
msgid ""
"**Quad-consumer policy (B5, 2026-09-24)**: every new example band delivers "
"FOUR consumers of one artifact — (1) example source, (2) a row in this index "
"with prose, (3) a CI-runnable test (ctest / smoke argv), (4) a wall entry "
"(one line in `examples/wasm/wall.json`, the manifest the web wall renders "
"from). Machine locks: gate-docs ⑧ (wall manifest == disk registry set) + ⑦ "
"(README count). Adding an example without registering it breaks the build "
"(R9 anti-glob); forgetting the wall.json line breaks gate-docs."
msgstr ""

