"New examples must register in the same round: Rust example = a registry line "
"in Bindings.cmake + an `[[example]]` block in `examples/rs`; C/C++ example = "
"a `visiaengine_add_example()` line in the corresponding "
"`examples/<lang>/CMakeLists.txt` (the anti-glob central ledger makes "
